claim.claim-text:
receiving, from a base station, a physical downlink control channel (PDCCH) order triggering the transmission of the CFRA preamble;
determining a timing offset value for a random access channel (RACH) occasion (RO) for the transmission of the CFRA preamble relative to a reference signal indicated in an active transmission configuration indicator (TCI) of one of a PDCCH and a physical downlink shared channel (PDSCH) of a current serving cell of the UE;
receiving the reference signal;
determining an arrival time of the reference signal;
determining a time of the RO by adding the timing offset value to the arrival time of the reference signal and subtracting one or more timing advance (TA) values; and
performing the transmission of the CFRA preamble during the RO.

